      "summary": "Matching cuts guessing among selection-type (choose-from-options items such as multiple-choice or true/false) items: each prompt must pair correctly across the set, so random luck helps far less than on a single multiple-choice pick. Essay is supply-type (write-in / short-answer items the student must produce), not selection-type.",
